<view class="page">
  <view class="header">
    <text class="title">收藏的饭</text>
    <text class="subtitle">好吃的决定，下次不用再纠结。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{favorites.length === 0}}" class="empty panel">
    <text>还没有收藏。去推荐页点“今天吃啥”，看到想吃的就收藏。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="list">
    <view wx:for="{{favorites}}" wx:key="id" class="favorite-card panel">
      <view class="card-head">
        <view>
          <text class="dish-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="meta">{{item.time}} · {{item.difficulty}}</text>
        </view>
        <button class="danger-button remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeFavorite">删除</button>
      </view>
      <text class="ingredients">{{item.ingredientsText}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
